== Birch Park ==
[[File:Birch Park (0.1).png|150px|thumb|Birch Park]]
{{Main|Birch Park}}
The Birch Park is where the player enters the Floating Islands from the Forest. It can also be accessed directly from the [[Player's Island]] by using a [[Portal]] unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Birch Wood|III}}. A launch pad leads back to the [[Hub Island]], and another leads into the Spruce Woods.

[[Birch Wood]] can be collected by mining Birch Trees, which is required to beat a quest.

== Spruce Woods ==
[[File:Spruce Woods (0.1).png|150px|thumb|Spruce Woods]]
{{Main|Spruce Woods}}
The Spruce Woods can only be accessed after obtaining [[Foraging]] II, by either using the portal unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Spruce Wood|III}} or using the launch pad in Birch Park. A launch pad leading to Jungle Island is located here.

[[Spruce Wood]] is the [[Collections|collection]] item obtainable here by mining spruce trees.

== Jungle Island ==
[[File:Jungle Island (0.1).png|150px|thumb|Jungle Island]]
{{Main|Jungle Island}}
Jungle Island can only be accessed after obtaining Foraging III, by either using the portal unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Jungle Wood|III}} or using the launch pad in Spruce Woods. A launch pad leading to Savanna Woodland is located here.

[[Jungle Wood]] is the main collection item obtainable here, simply by mining them. Rarely, [[Cocoa Beans]] can be obtained by breaking a wood block that they are attached to, making it possible to obtain them before achieving [[Farming]] V.

== Savanna Woodland ==
[[File:Savanna Woodland (0.1).png|150px|thumb|Savanna Woodland]]
{{Main|Savanna Woodland}}
Savanna Woodland can only be accessed after obtaining Foraging IV, by either using the portal unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Acacia Wood|III}} or using the launch pad in Jungle Island. A launch pad leading to Dark Thicket is located here.

[[Acacia Wood]] is the only collectible here, from mining the trees found here.

== Dark Thicket ==
[[File:Dark Thicket (0.1).png|150px|thumb|Dark Thicket]]
{{Main|Dark Thicket}}
Dark Thicket can only be accessed after obtaining Foraging V, by either using the portal unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Dark Oak Wood|III}} or using the launch pad in Savanna Woodland. A launch pad leading back to Birch Park is located here, but Birch Park doesn't contain a launch pad to here.

[[Dark Oak Wood]] is the main collection item here, simply by mining them. A stack of Dark Oak Wood is required for beating Charlie's quest. The [[Mushroom]]s can be obtained by breaking them, making them possible to obtain before Farming V.

